[{"id":758,"name":"AlphaRAR.qm_increments_resp","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.ResponseIncrement","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"86f3727a3525a3cd","local":"c2c884895476c0ae","content":"25a337a587f6b788"},"doc":"**The response-martingale increment maxima are `o_p(1)` and `o_p(√n)`**, the probabilistic core\nof the increment control for `Q` used in Appendix A of the paper. For each window the deterministic\nincrement control is `AlphaRAR.norm_increment_le_vmaxSeq_wmaxSeq`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"mΩ","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"m𝓐","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSingletonClass","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSingletonClass 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,24,"MeasurableSingletonClass"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Fintype","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"Fintype 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,7,"Fintype"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel","implicit":true,"name":"ν","role":"variable","type":"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel 𝓐 ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,24,"ProbabilityTheory.Kernel"],[27,28,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel ν","typeRefs":[[0,32,"ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasureTheory.Measure","implicit":true,"name":"P","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω","typeRefs":[[0,21,"MeasureTheory.Measure"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","im